# Document generation (FrontCRM)

Read and follow `document/System/文档生成规范.md` when creating or updating any repo Markdown docs.

## `document/EBS/` — read-only

- **Never modify** any file under `document/EBS/` (no edits, links, fixes, or FrontCRM notes).
- **Never create** FrontCRM design/implementation/QA docs under `document/EBS/`.
- Use EBS docs only as **read-only reference**; link to them from FrontCRM docs elsewhere.

## Where to write FrontCRM docs

| Type | Path |
|------|------|
| Design + implementation | `document/System/{domain}/` — `*-设计与实现.md` |
| QA test对照 | `document/QA/` |
| Analytics / dashboards | `document/IMP/` |
| User help | `help/pages/` (business language only) |

Wrong: `document/EBS/.../库存滚存-设计与实现.md`  
Right: `document/System/.../库存滚存-设计与实现.md` + link to EBS reference doc.
